          "line": 953,
          "original_text": "      business_logic: '- Start from intermediate.int_xero__general_ledger_fact, keeping rows where journal_date is present; select journal_date (cast to DATE), account_code, account_name, account_type, account_class, net_amount, region, department, project. - Create a continuous daily date spine from the minimum to the maximum journal_date (inclusive) at 1-day intervals. - For each date in the spine and for each combination of account_code, account_name, account_type, account_class, region, department, and project found in the ledger up to that date, compute a running_balance as the cumulative sum of net_amount for all ledger rows with journal_date on or before the report_date. Combinations with no prior activity yield no output after filtering (no backfilling before first activity). - Derive categories from account attributes: - balance_sheet_category: ASSET→\"Assets\"; LIABILITY→\"Liabilities\"; EQUITY/REVENUE/EXPENSE→\"Equity\"; anything else→\"Other\" (NULLs map to \"Other\"). - balance_sheet_subcategory: ASSET with type BANK or CURRENT→\"Current Assets\"; ASSET with type FIXED→\"Fixed Assets\"; LIABILITY with type CURRLIAB or TERMLIAB→\"Liabilities\"; EQUITY→\"Equity\"; anything else→\"Other\" (NULLs map to \"Other\"). - Keep only rows where running_balance is not equal to zero; rows with zero or NULL running_balance are excluded. - Set amount = running_balance. - Compute totals after filtering: - category_total = the sum of amount across all rows with the same report_date and balance_sheet_category. - subcategory_total = the sum of amount across all rows with the same report_date and balance_sheet_subcategory. - Set report_generated_at to the current timestamp at query time. The final ORDER BY (report_date DESC, then category, subcategory, account_code) is for presentation only.'\n",
          "association": "同一原文行同时提及列名和 precision/rounding/format/type-conversion 关键词；未判定语句适用范围"
        }
